	(text "Connects N15 to PROG_N15 for MIRA's negative program-drive domain. The\nopposed NMOS pair is controlled through U2201-U2203. MATRIX_OPTO_K links\ntheir LED return to Q2104 on the positive sheet; loss of drive turns the path\noff and enables discharge."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
